---
const rows = [
	{
		criterion: 'Who builds your site',
		michiana: 'Joe Hollenbach directly (local software engineer in Mishawaka)',
		diy: 'You, on nights and weekends',
		agency: 'Junior staff or outsourced subcontractors behind an account rep',
	},
	{
		criterion: 'Pricing & scope',
		michiana: 'Scaled to your business—from simple starter sites to full custom builds, quoted upfront',
		diy: '“Cheap” until paid plugins, broken layouts, and lost leads add up',
		agency: 'Large agency retainers and long-term monthly contracts',
	},
	{
		criterion: 'Mobile speed & reliability',
		michiana: 'Hand-built to load in under 1 second on any cell phone',
		diy: 'Heavy templates that often take 5–8 seconds on mobile',
		agency: 'Usually bloated WordPress themes with dozens of plugins',
	},
	{
		criterion: 'Local Google & AI search setup',
		michiana: 'Local SEO, town/service structure, and Google-ready business data built in from day one',
		diy: 'Generic settings that miss local Michiana search signals',
		agency: 'Sold separately as a pricey ongoing monthly fee',
	},
	{
		criterion: 'Ongoing updates & care',
		michiana: 'Optional hosting plan includes SSL, backups, and 1 hr/mo of updates by me',
		diy: 'You troubleshoot broken updates and security alerts yourself',
		agency: 'High hourly billing or slow support ticket queues',
	},
	{
		criterion: 'Site & domain ownership',
		michiana: 'You own 100% of your domain, content, and finished website',
		diy: 'Locked into a proprietary platform',
		agency: 'Often tied to continuing an agency contract',
	},
];
---

<section id="why-michiana-dev" class="theme-light relative border-t border-line py-24 sm:py-32" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
	<div class="container-x">
		<div class="reveal max-w-3xl">
			<p class="eyebrow">Why Michiana Dev</p>
			<h2 id="why-heading" class="display mt-5 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)]">
				Agency-caliber engineering, <span class="serif-accent text-gradient">without the agency runaround.</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">
				Most local business owners are stuck choosing between a slow DIY website builder they don’t have time to wrestle with, or an expensive agency that hands their business off to a junior account manager. Here is how working directly with a local engineer compares:
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="reveal mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface shadow-[0_18px_48px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]">
			<div class="overflow-x-auto">
				<table class="w-full min-w-[680px] border-collapse text-left text-[0.95rem]">
					<thead>
						<tr class="border-b border-line-strong bg-sand/60">
							<th scope="col" class="py-4 pr-4 pl-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">What matters</th>
							<th scope="col" class="py-4 px-5 font-semibold text-ink">
								<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
									<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-leaf"></span>
									Michiana Dev (Mishawaka)
								</span>
							</th>
							<th scope="col" class="py-4 px-5 font-medium text-muted">DIY Builders (Wix / WordPress)</th>
							<th scope="col" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-5 font-medium text-muted">Traditional Marketing Agencies</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody class="divide-y divide-line">
						{rows.map((r) => (
							<tr class="align-top transition-colors hover:bg-sand/30">
								<th scope="row" class="py-4 pr-4 pl-6 font-semibold text-ink">{r.criterion}</th>
								<td class="bg-leaf/[0.05] py-4 px-5 font-medium text-ink">{r.michiana}</td>
								<td class="py-4 px-5 text-body">{r.diy}</td>
								<td class="py-4 pr-6 pl-5 text-body">{r.agency}</td>
							</tr>
						))}
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
			<p class="text-body">
				Not sure if your current website needs a full rebuild or just a few targeted fixes? I’ll give you a straight answer for free.
			</p>
			<a href="#contact" class="btn-primary shrink-0">
				Get a free website review
				<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
